# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.
#
# This project currently has NO build step, so its publish root is the
# repository root — every committed file is fetchable over HTTPS. Until the
# Pages build command and output directory are set (see
# docs/cloudflare-deployment-audit.md section 9.1), these rules keep
# repository content that is not part of the website from being served.
#
# Remove this file once a real build step exists and the output directory
# contains only built assets.

# Internal documentation — must not be served publicly.
/docs/*             /404.html   404

# Repository metadata and governance files.
/.github/*          /404.html   404
/LICENSE            /404.html   404
/SECURITY.md        /404.html   404
/README.md          /404.html   404
/.gitignore         /404.html   404
